<BRK/>
<TXT>Support bench tops with welded metal tube pedestals or welded metal wall brackets with a minimum of two support points for each bench length.  
Maximum length<MET> 1829 mm</MET><ENG> 72 inches</ENG>.  Height from finished floor to top of bench<MET> [445][_____] mm</MET><ENG> [17-1/2][_____] inches</ENG>.  Fabricate pedestal and wall 
brackets from[ powder coated galvanized steel][ stainless steel].  Provide stainless steel fasteners and anchors.  Space support points for each 
bench as required to support<MET> 150 kg/m</MET><ENG> 100 plf</ENG> with maximum deflection not to exceed L/180 between supports.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
